Lifecycle reference for plan statuses and transitions across skills. Lazy-loaded by `/chat` when the user asks about valid moves or wants a status change. Operational gates (cross-validation, redecomposition checks) and side-effect ceremony are intentionally omitted — those belong to the owning skill's contract in `src/templates/_partials/_plan_transitions.j2`.

Transitions are executed deterministically: a single `booping transition <to> <plan>` command performs the status change and applies every mechanical mutation it entails (date stamps, commit snapshot, `sprints.md` re-render, vault commit). Don't hand-edit `status:` in the frontmatter.
